Package: dhcpsd
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: DHCP service daemon
 dhcpsd is a lightweight DHCP server daemon that provides IP address
 assignment and network configuration to DHCP clients on a local network.
 .
 This package provides a simple and efficient DHCP server implementation
 suitable for small networks and embedded systems.
